WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.750 line:-3
Meet Kawayan, your AI social media manager.

2
00:00:03.750 --> 00:00:05.650 line:-3
Tell it what this month is about,

3
00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:10.260 line:-3
and in seconds, it plans sixteen post ideas in your brand's voice.

4
00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:14.700 line:-3
Pick an idea, and Kawayan writes the whole post:

5
00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:20.009 line:-3
a natural Taglish caption, a matching visual, and a virality score.

6
00:00:20.450 --> 00:00:25.689 line:-3
Then preview exactly how it will look on Instagram, TikTok, and Facebook.

7
00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:31.400 line:-3
Choose a time, and schedule it in one click.

8
00:00:32.250 --> 00:00:34.150 line:-3
Done. It's scheduled,

9
00:00:34.150 --> 00:00:36.809 line:-3
and the rest of your month is already planned.

10
00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:40.500 line:-3
Kawayan. Social media, on autopilot.
